  <section class="lp-section lp-paper" id="zoominfo-pricing"><div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="lp-heading"><p class="lp-kicker">02 / Get the cost straight</p><h2>ZoomInfo pricing:<br>ask for the whole commitment.</h2><p>The main platform pricing page requires an enquiry. That makes it harder for a small team to compare costs quickly. We would ask for a written, itemised offer before investing much time in a demo.</p></div>
    <div class="zi-two-col"><div><h3>What does ZoomInfo include?</h3><p>ZoomInfo offers company and contact intelligence alongside prospecting, enrichment and broader sales and marketing workflows. The relevant question is which of those products your proposed package includes and which your team will use.</p><p>Write down the essential jobs: find suitable companies, identify buyers, obtain useful numbers and send the records into your calling process. Then list any account signals or automation you rely on. That becomes the scope every alternative must price.</p><p class="lp-sources"><a href="https://www.zoominfo.com/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ZoomInfo's current products and pricing enquiry ↗</a></p></div><div><h3>Its pricing model is changing.</h3><p>ZoomInfo's November 2026 filing describes a hybrid model introduced in the third quarter: an annual platform fee, prepaid credits and other arrangements alongside seat-based packages.</p><p>The same filing says its SaaS subscriptions typically run one to three years and are non-cancelable. Your order determines your terms. Separate the payment schedule from the period you are committing to.</p><p class="lp-sources"><a href="https://zoominfotechnologiesinc.gcs-web.com/static-files/6c350fee-34b0-40f1-a15f-c81353e40350#page=39" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ZoomInfo's November 4 filing, pricing and subscriptions ↗</a></p></div></div>
    <div class="zi-price-note"><h3>There is also a separate usage-based offer.</h3><p>GTM.ai advertises 1,000 data credits and 1,000 AI credits at signup, with top-ups from USD 20. It provides access through connected AI tools, APIs and command-line tools. Mobile phone data is listed with Enterprise.</p><p>Check which data and tools the offer includes, what setup it needs and what you will pay after any promotion ends.</p><p class="lp-sources"><a href="https://gtm.ai/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GTM.ai credits, top-ups and Enterprise features ↗</a></p></div>
    <div class="lp-note"><strong>CallTeam verdict: start with the clearly priced options.</strong><p>If you mainly need contacts, start with Apollo, UpLead and Lead411. Compare their prices and samples with your ZoomInfo quote. Pay more only when the extra data or features help your team do the work. A familiar brand alone is a weak reason to sign.</p></div>
  </div></section>

